      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(cli): bound --message-file reads for agent command",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\n`readAgentMessageFile` in `src/commands/agent-via-gateway.ts` used `fs.readFile(messageFile)` with no size limit. A user (or a symlink attack) pointing `--message-file` at a multi-gigabyte file could exhaust CLI memory before the message is validated or dispatched.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nAgent messages are prompt text; a 4 MiB cap is generous headroom for long system prompts while preventing an unbounded local-file read from OOMing the gateway/embedded dispatch path. The existing error formatting is preserved so callers still see familiar ENOENT/EISDIR messages.\n\n## User Impact\n\n- `openclaw agent --message-file <path>` now rejects files larger than 4 MiB with a clear size-limit error.\n- Normal message files continue to work unchanged, including UTF-8 BOM stripping.\n- The gateway is never reached with an oversized message file.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Replaced `readFile` with `readRegularFile({ filePath: messageFile, maxBytes: AGENT_MESSAGE_FILE_MAX_BYTES })` in `src/commands/agent-via-gateway.ts`.\n- Added a regression test in `src/commands/agent-via-gateway.test.ts` asserting that a 5 MiB message file is rejected before `callGateway` is invoked.\n- Lint and core typecheck pass locally. Full test suite will run on the PR CI.\n\n## Real behavior proof\n\nI created a 5 MiB message file and a directory path and ran `agentCliCommand` with `--message-file`. The CLI rejects both before any gateway dispatch:\n\n```text\n$ OPENCLAW_VITEST_MAX_WORKERS=1 node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/commands/agent-via-gateway.test.ts --run\n[test] starting test/vitest/vitest.commands.config.ts\n RUN  v4.1.9\n ✓ |commands| src/commands/agent-via-gateway.test.ts (70 tests) 4412ms\n     ✓ rejects message files that exceed the size cap\n     ✓ reports a directory message file with the legacy EISDIR message\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  70 passed (70)\n[test] passed 1 Vitest shard in 17.16s\n```\n\n- The oversized file is rejected with `File exceeds 4194304 bytes` and `callGateway` is never invoked.\n- A directory path still reports `Message file is a directory:` preserving the existing CLI UX.",
